<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">HUAMAO COMMUNITY / 花友互助</view><block wx:if="{{mode === 'list'}}"><view class="title">花与它的事，<view>一起聊聊。</view></view><view class="muted">公益交流 · 互相帮助 · 分享真实生活</view><view class="notice">本地试用：帖子和回复仅当前账号在本机可见，不会发布到公共社区。云端共享与审核接通后开放。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="compose">＋ 发帖交流 / 提问</button><input class="forum-input" placeholder="搜索帖子标题或内容" value="{{query}}" data-field="query" bindinput="input"/><view class="chips"><text wx:for="{{filters}}" wx:key="*this" class="chip {{category === item ? 'active' : ''}}" data-value="{{item}}" bindtap="filter">{{item}}</text></view><view class="muted">最新发布 · {{posts.length}} 篇本机帖子</view><view class="card" wx:for="{{posts}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="open"><view class="badge">{{item.category}}</view><view class="name post-title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="post-excerpt">{{item.content}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.nickname}} · {{item.date}} · {{item.replies.length}} 条回复</view></view><view class="card" wx:if="{{!posts.length}}"><view class="name">{{query ? '暂时没有找到相关帖子' : '第一声问候，留给你。'}}</view><view class="body">聊聊花怎么养、植物怎么隔离，或者分享你和毛孩子的日常。</view></view><view class="section">花友公约</view><view class="muted">友善交流，请勿发布广告、交易信息或个人联系方式。养护经验不能证明植物无毒；不鼓励试吃、接触测试或自行用药。疑似误食请及时联系兽医，不要等待社区回复。</view></block><block wx:elif="{{mode === 'compose'}}"><button bindtap="back">‹ 返回互助广场（保留草稿）</button><view class="title">写下你的问题<view>或生活发现。</view></view><picker range="{{categories}}" value="{{categoryIndex}}" bindchange="categoryChange"><view class="chip">{{categories[categoryIndex]}} ▾</view></picker><input class="forum-input" placeholder="标题：4 至 60 字" maxlength="60" value="{{title}}" data-field="title" bindinput="input"/><textarea class="forum-text" placeholder="请描述植物名称、养护环境和具体问题；不要填写手机号、地址等个人信息。正文 10 至 2000 字。" maxlength="2000" value="{{content}}" data-field="content" bindinput="input"/><view class="muted">{{content.length}} / 2000</view><view class="notice">仅保存到当前账号的本机空间。疑似误食或宠物不适，请立即联系兽医。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="publish">保存帖子（仅本机）</button></block><block wx:elif="{{post}}"><button bindtap="back">‹ 返回互助广场</button><view class="badge">{{post.category}}</view><view class="title">{{post.title}}</view><view class="muted">{{post.nickname}} · {{post.date}} · 仅本机</view><view class="body forum-body">{{post.content}}</view><view class="notice">个人经验未经核实，不能替代毒性依据或兽医诊断。疑似误食不要等待回复。</view><view class="section">交流回复 · {{post.replies.length}}</view><view class="card" wx:for="{{post.replies}}" wx:key="id"><view class="name">{{item.nickname}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.date}} · 仅本机</view><view class="body forum-body">{{item.content}}</view></view><view class="muted" wx:if="{{!post.replies.length}}">还没有回复，真实的观察和友善的建议都很珍贵。</view><textarea class="forum-text reply-text" placeholder="写下友善的回复，5 至 1000 字" maxlength="1000" value="{{replyText}}" data-field="replyText" bindinput="input"/><button class="primary" bindtap="reply">保存回复（仅本机）</button></block><view class="notice" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view></view>
